<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina March industrial output up 5.8 pct - FIEL.</title>
<headline>Argentina March industrial output up 5.8 pct - FIEL.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's industrial production in March rose 5.8 percent, the private consultancy FIEL said in a preliminary report.</p>
<p>The government is expected to release official figures later in the day.</p>
</text>
